<title>USA: Ramsay gets favorable lawsuit judgment.</title>
<headline>Ramsay gets favorable lawsuit judgment.</headline>
<dateline>CORAL GABLES, Fla. 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ramsay Health Care Inc said on Tuesday it prevailed in a four-year lawsuit which it brought against the Missouri Department of Social Services, and the judgment would add about $2.4 million to second quarter pre-tax income.</p>
<p>The courts, which awarded Ramsay a cash judgment, ruled Ramsay's Heartland Hospital in Nevada, Mo., had received insufficient reimbursement from the Department of Social Services for provision of behavioral care to Medicaid patients from 1990 to 1996.</p>
<p>Ramsay Health Care is a behavioral health services company.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
